{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel adaptation of The Communist Manifesto by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Manifesto in a conversational style and choose your own topics to focus on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether to ask Engels for footnotes. Unlock the ending after reading Chapters 1, 2, and 3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more detail about the vocabulary used in the glossary and track your completion of the glossary to unlock extra features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra features including music, introductions, postscript, backgrounds, and the image gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what music to play from the soundtrack using the Music Select menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 19th century paintings related to locations and events of the Manifesto and its authors to display as backgrounds during your reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your reading experience further by turning off choice menus, music changes, and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and view images of the authors, drawings of them, and sketches by Engels.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Workers of the World, Unite!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665800/4d7bfb37253bdf4e08ea7effcad811d5a8524704.jpg"},{"name":"Introduce Community","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665800/a68e98bf038d595ac62482a348a016933115b314.jpg"},{"name":"Unmistakable Letters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665800/3352097b0a73d971192c57b5e9212ac86124faf9.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Confession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665800/d0f750684607460b28e4931be888ca4547